<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Jonas</para>
  <para style="toc1">JONAS</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jonas</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jon</para>
  <para style="mt1">JONAS</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:25">II Wa 14:25</ref> </char></note>Jonas, fis a Amitthaï a. Li te di: <verse eid="JON 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2"/>“Leve, ale Ninive, gran vil la, e kriye kont li, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20">Jen 18:20</ref> </char></note>mechanste yo monte devan Mwen.”<verse eid="JON 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3"/>Men Jonas te leve al kache<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1">És 23:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 23:6">6</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 23:10">10</ref></char></note>Tarsis pou kite prezans SENYÈ a. Konsa, li te desann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:46">Jos 19:46</ref> </char></note>Joppa, e li te jwenn yon bato ki t ap prale Tarsis. Li te peye frè a, e te desann ladann pou ale avèk yo Tarsis pou l envite prezans SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JON 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:23-28">Sòm 107:23-28</ref> </char></note>SENYÈ a te lanse yon gwo van sou lanmè a. Te gen yon gwo tanpèt sou lanmè a jiskaske bato a te prèt pou kraze nèt. <verse eid="JON 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5"/>Answit, ouvriye bato yo te vin pè e yo chak te kriye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:26">I Wa 18:26</ref></char></note>pwòp dye pa yo. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:18">Trav 27:18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 27:19">19</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 27:38">38</ref> </char></note>vide chaj ki te nan bato a nan lanmè a pou te fè l pi lejè. Men Jonas te ale anba nan fon bato a, epi kote li te kouche a, li te tonbe dòmi. <verse eid="JON 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6"/>Konsa, kapitèn bato a te pwoche li e te di: “Kòman fè w ap dòmi an? Leve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:28">Sòm 107:28</ref></char></note>rele dye pa ou a. Petèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:22">II Sam 12:22</ref> </char></note>dye ou a va fè pa nou pou nou pa peri.”<verse eid="JON 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7"/>Chak mesye yo te di a konparèy yo: “Vini, annou fè tiraj osò pou nou ka konprann sou kont kilès gwo malè sa a rive nou an.” Yo te fè tiraj osò a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:23">Nonb 32:23</ref> </char></note>sò a te tonbe sou Jonas. <verse eid="JON 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8"/>Konsa yo te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:19">Jos 7:19</ref> </char></note>“Pale nou koulye a! Sou kont a kilès malè sa a rive nou an? Ki metye ou? Epi ki kote ou sòti? Ki peyi ou? Nan ki pèp ou sòti?”<verse eid="JON 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9"/>Li te di yo: “Mwen se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:13">Jen 14:13</ref> </char></note>Ebre, e mwen gen lakrent pou SENYÈ Bondye syèl la, ki te fè lanmè a ak tè sèch la.” <verse eid="JON 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10"/>Pou sa a, mesye yo te vin pè anpil e yo te di li: “Kisa ou te fè la?” Paske mesye yo te deja konprann ke li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:22">Job 27:22</ref> </char></note>t ap sove ale sòti kite prezans a SENYÈ a, akoz sa li te di yo. <verse eid="JON 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11"/>Konsa, yo te di l: “Kisa pou nou ta fè ou pou lanmè a vin kalm pou nou?” Paske lanmè a t ap vin pi move plis toujou.<verse eid="JON 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12"/>Li te di yo: “Leve mwen, jete m nan lanmè a. Konsa, lanmè va vin kalm pou nou; paske mwen konnen ke se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:17">II Sam 24:17</ref> </char></note>akoz mwen menm ke gwo tanpèt sa a rive sou nou.”<verse eid="JON 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13"/>Sepandan, mesye yo te bouje zaviwon yo fò pou yo ta ka rive atè, men yo pa t kapab, paske lanmè te vin pi move kont yo. <verse eid="JON 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14"/>Pou sa a, yo te rele SENYÈ a e te di: “O SENYÈ, pa kite nou peri sou kont a nonm sila a, ni pa mete san inosan sou nou; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:3">Sòm 115:3</ref> </char></note>Ou menm, O SENYÈ, Ou fè sa ki fè Ou plezi.” <verse eid="JON 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15"/>Konsa, yo te leve Jonas, yo te voye li nan lanmè a, e lanmè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 65:7">Sòm 65:7</ref> </char></note>te vin sispann anraje. <verse eid="JON 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16"/>Epi mesye yo te vin krent SENYÈ a anpil. Yo te ofri yon sakrifis a SENYÈ a e te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:14">Sòm 50:14</ref> </char></note>ve yo a Li menm.<verse eid="JON 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17"/>Epi SENYÈ a te chwazi yon gwo pwason pou vale Jonas, e Jonas te nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mat 12:40</ref> </char></note>vant pwason a pandan twa jou ak twa nwit.<verse eid="JON 1:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1"/>Konsa, Jonas te priye a SENYÈ Bondye li a depi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:15">Job 13:15</ref> </char></note>nan vant pwason an. <verse eid="JON 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2"/>Li te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">“Mwen te rele nan detrès mwen bay SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">e Li te reponn mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">Mwen te kriye pou sekou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">depi nan pwofondè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:5">Sòm 18:5</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 18:6">6</ref></char></note>sejou mò yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">Ou te tande vwa mwen.<verse eid="JON 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3"/>Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:1">Sòm 69:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 69:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 69:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 69:15">15</ref></char></note>jete mwen nan gwo pwofondè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">nan kè lanmè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">e gwo kouran dlo a te vale mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">Gwo lam lanmè ou yo ak gwo vag lanmè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">ou yo te pase sou mwen.<verse eid="JON 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4"/>Konsa, mwen te di: ‘Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:22">Sòm 31:22</ref></char></note>vin chase lwen fas ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:4">Malgre sa, mwen va gade ankò vè tanp sen Ou an.’<verse eid="JON 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LAM 3:54">Lam 3:54</ref> </char>
    </note>Dlo te antoure mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:5">jiskaske m rive nan pwen lanmò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:5">Gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:1-2">Sòm 69:1-2</ref></char></note>pwofondè a te vale mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:5">zèb lanmè yo te vlope tèt mwen.<verse eid="JON 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6"/>Mwen te desann jis rive nan baz mòn yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">Latè ak bawo li yo te antoure mwen pou tout tan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">men Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:28">Job 33:28</ref></char></note>leve lavi m monte soti nan fòs la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">O SENYÈ Bondye mwen an!<verse eid="JON 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7"/>“Pandan mwen t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 142:3">Sòm 142:3</ref> </char></note>vin endispoze nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:7">Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 77:10">Sòm 77:10</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 77:11">11</ref></char></note>sonje SENYÈ a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:7">e lapriyè mwen te rive kote Ou nan tanp sen Ou an.<verse eid="JON 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8"/>Sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:15">II Wa 17:15</ref></char></note>konsidere zidòl san valè yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:8">abandone tout sous mizerikòd,<verse eid="JON 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9"/>Men mwen va fè sakrifis a Ou menm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:9">ak vwa aksyon de gras la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:9">Sa ke mwen te sèmante a, se li mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:27">Job 22:27</ref></char></note>akonpli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:9">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 3:8">Sòm 3:8</ref> </char>
    </note>Sali a sòti nan SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="JON 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10"/>Epi SENYÈ a te kòmande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:17">Jon 1:17</ref></char></note>pwason an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:10">e li te vomi Jonas sou tè sèch la.<verse eid="JON 2:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1"/>Alò, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a Jonas pou yon dezyèm fwa. Li te di: <verse eid="JON 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2"/>“Leve ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 2:13">So 2:13</ref></char></note>Ninive, gwo vil la e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:17">Jr 1:17</ref> </char></note>pwoklame a li menm tout pwoklamasyon ke Mwen va pale ou yo.”<verse eid="JON 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3"/>Konsa, Jonas te ale Ninive selon pawòl SENYÈ a. Alò, Ninive te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:2">Jon 1:2</ref> </char></note>tèlman yon gwo vil, li te pran twa jou ap mache pou travèse l. <verse eid="JON 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4"/>Jonas te kòmanse travèse vil la pandan yon jou. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:41">Mat 12:41</ref> </char></note>kriye fò e te di: “Nan karant jou, Ninive va detwi nèt.”<verse eid="JON 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5"/>Answit, pèp Ninive lan te kwè Bondye. Yo te deklare yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:3">Dan 9:3</ref> </char></note>jèn e yo te mete twal sak soti nan pi gran pou rive nan pi piti pami yo. <verse eid="JON 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6"/>Lè pawòl la te rive kote wa Ninive lan, li te leve soti sou twòn li, e te mete manto wayal li sou kote. Li te kouvri tèt li ak twal sak e li te chita nan mitan sann.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:1-4">Est 4:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JON 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7"/>Li te pibliye yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:3">II Kwo 20:3</ref> </char></note>pwoklamasyon. Li te di: “Nan Ninive, pa dekrè wa a, ak prens li yo: Pa kite ni lòm, ni bèt, ni bann mouton, ni twoupo goute anyen. Pa kite yo ni manje ni bwè dlo. <verse eid="JON 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8"/>Men ni lòm ni bèt dwe vin kouvri ak twal sak. Konsa, kite yo rele Bondye avèk tout kè yo, pou tout moun kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:16-19">És 1:16-19</ref> </char></note>vire kite chemen mechan yo a, e vire kite vyolans ki nan men yo. <verse eid="JON 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:22">II Sam 12:22</ref> </char></note>Kilès ki konnen, petèt Bondye va repanti, e ralanti sou gwo kòlè Li a pou nou pa peri.”<verse eid="JON 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10"/>Lè Bondye te wè zèv yo, ke yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:27-29">I Wa 21:27-29</ref></char></note>vire kite chemen mechan yo a, alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:14">Egz 32:14</ref> </char></note>Bondye te repanti de gwo malè ke Li te deklare pou fè rive sou yo a. Epi Li pa t fè sa ankò.<verse eid="JON 3:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1"/>Men sa te fè Jonas pa kontan anpil e li te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 4:4">Jon 4:4</ref> </char></note>fache. <verse eid="JON 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2"/>Li te priye a SENYÈ a. Li te di: “Souple, SENYÈ, èske se pa sa ke m te di lè m te nan pwòp peyi mwen an? Alò, se pou m te evite sa ki fè m te sove ale rive Tarsis. Paske mwen te konnen ke Ou se yon Bondye ki plen gras ak mizerikòd, ki lan nan kòlè, ki ranpli ak lanmou dous, e Ou se Sila ki ralanti selon malè a. <verse eid="JON 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3"/>Alò, pou sa, koulye a, O SENYÈ, souple, pran lavi mwen. Paske lanmò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:15">Job 7:15</ref>,<ref loc="JOB 7:16">16</ref> </char></note>pi bon ke lavi pou mwen.”<verse eid="JON 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4"/>SENYÈ a te di: “Èske ou gen bon rezon pou ou fache a?”<verse eid="JON 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5"/>Epi Jonas te sòti nan vil la e te chita sou kote lès la. La, li te fè yon tonèl pou li menm, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:9">I Wa 19:9</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 19:13">13</ref> </char></note>chita anba l nan lonbraj jis pou l ta wè sa ki ta rive nan vil la. <verse eid="JON 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6"/>Konsa, SENYÈ Bondye a te chwazi yon plant lyann. Lyann nan te monte grandi sou Jonas pou l ta sèvi kon abri sou tèt li, pou delivre l de mekontantman li an. Epi lyann nan te fè Jonas byen kontan. <verse eid="JON 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7"/>Men Bondye te chwazi yon cheni nan granmmaten nan pwochen jou a. Li te atake lyann nan e li te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:12">Jl 1:12</ref> </char></note>fennen. <verse eid="JON 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8"/>Lè solèy la te leve, Bondye te chwazi yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 19:12">Éz 19:12</ref></char></note>van lès byen cho, solèy la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 121:6">Sòm 121:6</ref> </char></note>te bat tèt Jonas jiskaske li te vin fèb. Konsa, li t ap mande ak tout nanm li, e te di: “Lanmò pi bon ke lavi pou mwen.”<verse eid="JON 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9"/>Epi Bondye te di a Jonas: “Èske ou gen bon rezon pou fache akoz lyann nan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 4:9">Jonas te reponn: “Mwen gen bon rezon pou m fache, menm jiska lanmò.”<verse eid="JON 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di: “Ou te gen konpasyon pou plant sila ke ou pa t fè okenn travay pou li a, ke ou menm pa t fè grandi, ki te vin parèt nan yon nwit e te vin peri nan yon nwit. <verse eid="JON 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11"/>Èske Mwen pa ta dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:10">Jon 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:39">Det 1:39</ref> </char></note>gen konpasyon pou Ninive, gwo vil la, nan sila ki genyen plis ke san-ven-mil moun ki pa konn diferans antre men dwat ak men goch yo ak yon gwo kantite bèt, tou?”<verse eid="JON 4:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4"/>
</usx>
